        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Poor appetite; usually eats 1 small meal per day plus occasional snacks, with early satiety. Patient says, \"Food just doesn't do it.\" Smell of cooking is off-putting."
      }
    },
